===Notable former players===
* '''[[Naoto Kongo]]''' — Middle linebacker (2012–2019). 3× Division 1 Defensive Player of the Year, 2015 Rice Bowl MVP. No. 36 retired. Transitioned to competitive bodybuilding; 2× Iron Sakura Classic champion.
* '''[[Tatsuo Kanzaki]]''' — Quarterback (1993–2005). Precision passer who led the Direwolves to their first Rice Bowl title in 1997 and mentored a young Kengo Shibata.
* '''[[Shinji Maeda]]''' — Quarterback (2006–2009). First post-Kanzaki starter; struggled with consistency.
* '''[[Koji Asakura]]''' — Quarterback (2009–2012). Brief starter during the transition era.
* '''[[Ren Takahashi]]''' — Quarterback (2010–2013). Final quarterback of the pre-Mizushima era.
* '''[[Hiroshi Genda]]''' — Defensive tackle (1995–2008). Anchor of the interior line during the first dynasty.
* '''[[Manabu Kudou]]''' — Wide receiver (1998–2010). Kanzaki's favorite target and the franchise's all-time receiving leader.
* '''[[Shigeki Noda]]''' — Cornerback (1997–2011). Lockdown corner during the first dynasty era.
* '''[[Kenji Iwabuchi]]''' — Safety (2000–2014). Veteran defensive back who bridged the first dynasty and the Iron Curtain era.
* '''[[Hisashi Morimoto]]''' — Defensive coordinator (2011–2019). Architect of the Iron Curtain defense.

